# Splice.com sound samples - licensed for use in this game, but Splice's
# terms don't allow redistributing the raw sample files themselves. See
# README's Credits/License section. Anyone cloning this repo needs to
# supply their own copies (or their own licensed sounds) at the same paths
# for these effects to play - the game degrades gracefully without them
# (see sound.js's initSound, which already treats a missing/failed clip as
# a soft warning, not a crash).
